      "title": "Healthy Workplace",
      "description": "Healthy Workplace - Jobs at Monash Home Courses Monash Online Library Donate Previous menu Toggle navigation Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Benefits Healthy Workplace Healthy Workplace Campus life Campus life Job search at Monash Job search at Monash How to apply How to apply How to apply International applicants International applicants Career reflection Career reflection Searching for a job Searching for a job Applying for a job Applying for a job What to expect What to expect Preparing for an interview Preparing for an interview FAQs FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Policies & Procedures Contact Us Contact Us Skip to content Skip to navigation Home Home icon Monash Australia Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Courses Monash Online Library Donate Staff Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Students Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Alumni Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Search Menu Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Healthy Workplace Campus life Job search at Monash How to apply International applicants Career reflection Searching for a job Applying for a job What to expect Preparing for an interview FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us More Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us Toggle Search Close Close\n                        Search Search Why work at Monash Benefits Healthy Workplace Campus life You are here: Home | Why work at Monash | Healthy Workplace Healthy Workplace We value and understand the importance of health and wellbeing for our staff, students and community. That's why we're involved in initiatives promoting the importance of a healthy body, mind and lifestyle. Our award-winning health and wellbeing initiatives and programs, alongisde  our state-of-art sporting facilities and a wide range of staff discounts make Monash a great place to work. A brief summary of the programs, activities and facilities we have available are listed below. Physical Activity Staff Wellbeing Activity Program (including classes such as Pilates, Boxing and Yoga) 10,000 Steps Challenge Monash Walk & Fun Run Zumba After Dark Monash Sport Fitness and Aquatic facilities, programs and events Mental Health Mindfulness and Mental Health Programs On-campus counselling Employee Assistance Program: 24-hour assistance for our staff and their families on work or personal matters Manager assist :  a phone consulting service providing practical advice and support to supervisors and managers Mental Health First Aid training: learn how to help someone with a mental health problem before seeking professional help Nutrition Smart Eating Week Planetary Health Campaign Try for 5 Campaign Nutrition webinars/ seminars Access to recipe and resource bank Online courses including Food as Medicine Provision of healthy snacks in vending machines Healthy catering guide for meetings and events General Health University Health Checks Ergonomics and computer use guides for optimal set up of desk and working spaces Flu vaccination program Hearing Tests First Aid training and provisions Smoke-free Monash We encourage you to learn about the full range of staff benefits available to you here at Monash. Further information is available at https://www.monash.edu/staff-health-wellbeing Welcome to the Monash team! We acknowledge and pay respects to the Elders and Traditional Owners of the land on which our Australian campuses stand. I