    "https://www.monash.edu/jobs/why-work-at-monash/campus-life": {
      "title": "Campus life",
      "description": "Campus life - Jobs at Monash Home Courses Monash Online Library Donate Previous menu Toggle navigation Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Benefits Healthy Workplace Healthy Workplace Campus life Campus life Job search at Monash Job search at Monash How to apply How to apply How to apply International applicants International applicants Career reflection Career reflection Searching for a job Searching for a job Applying for a job Applying for a job What to expect What to expect Preparing for an interview Preparing for an interview FAQs FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Policies & Procedures Contact Us Contact Us Skip to content Skip to navigation Home Home icon Monash Australia Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Courses Monash Online Library Donate Staff Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Students Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Alumni Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Search Menu Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Healthy Workplace Campus life Job search at Monash How to apply International applicants Career reflection Searching for a job Applying for a job What to expect Preparing for an interview FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us More Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us Toggle Search Close Close\n                        Search Search Why work at Monash Benefits Healthy Workplace Campus life You are here: Home | Why work at Monash | Campus life Campus life Getting regular physical activity is one of the best things you can do to improve your health. We provide a range of programs, services and resources to help you get fit, and encourage you to get involved in the types of physical activities that fit your lifestyle and interests. Monash Sport Monash sports facilities are available for staff to use and there are some great discounts on offer. Check out Monash Sport for sport and exercise options. Staff Wellbeing Activity Program – SWAP Our Staff Wellbeing and Activity Program (SWAP) offers a range of activities you're welcome to join. Sports includes yoga, pilates, boxing, mindfulness sessions and much more. Activities are organised within departments or by Monash Sport. We make it easier to improve your wellbeing, productivity and work-life balance with discount programs created for all ages and fitness levels. Our SWAP mindfulness and essence programs, nutrition, diabetes and health and information sessions can also be arranged on request. Health services Monash has a wide range of cost-effective health services on campus for your convenience. Our medical clinics at the Caulfield, Clayton and Peninsula campuses are open from 9am to 5pm weekdays. Campus retailers Life on the Monash campus involves a variety of eating and drinking options, from bustling cafes, places to meet friends or food to go when you just need a quick bite. Most campuses have a range of retail shops. Whether it’s a convenience store, chemist or hairdresser, there are plenty of options to assist you on campus. Safety on campus Our Safer Community Unit provides expert advice, support, intervention, investigation and risk management to reduce the risk of inappropriate and threatening behaviour. It also offers a range of services, including Family Violence Contact Officers. We acknowledge and pay respects to the Elders and Traditional Owners of the land on which our Australian campuses stand. Information for Indigenous Australians Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Monash Sitemap Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Monash Sitemap Registered Australian University ABN: 12 377 614 012 TEQSA Provider ID: PRV12140 CRICOS Provider Number Monash University: 00008C Monash College: 01857J Authorised by Executive Director, Marketing Website feedback Last updated: Feb 2020 Accessibility Disclaimer & copyright Terms & conditions Data privacy & cyber security Data Consent Settings Copyright © 2026 Monash University We use cookies to improve your experience, but you can choose which ones we use, and opt-out at any time. You can find more information in our Website Terms and Conditions Accept  all Cookie settings"
