e our walls. Whether you want to be part of world-renowned research or take the next step in your professional life, we have a range of opportunities to explore. Jobs at Monash Australia From a great environment and reputation, to exciting development opportunities, there are many reasons to join the Monash community. Jobs for Indigenous Australians Click here to find out more information about employment at Monash University for Indigenous Australians Jobs for Staff Already working at Monash University and looking to advance your career? We have a great range of internal roles. Jobs for Students Are you a current Monash student? Jump start your career with our Jobs for Students program. Get experience and build your employability while you study. Jobs at Monash Malaysia Whether seeking an academic or professional position, you will quickly see the benefits and opportunities of working at Monash University Malaysia within a dynamic community of scholars. Explore Monash Indonesia Monash Indonesia is recruiting a number of outstanding academic and professional positions across a range of areas and levels. Access your application Log in to complete an application or induction, or view your offer online. We acknowledge and pay respects to the Elders and Traditional Owners of the land on which our Australian campuses stand. Information for Indigenous Australians Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Monash Sitemap Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Lates