    "https://careers.pageuppeople.com/513/cw/en/job/697855/clinical-site-administrator": {
      "title": "Job Search - Jobs at Monash",
      "description": "Job Search - Jobs at Monash Home Courses Monash Online Library Donate Previous menu Toggle navigation Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Benefits Healthy Workplace Healthy Workplace Campus life Campus life Job search at Monash Job search at Monash How to apply How to apply How to apply International applicants International applicants Career reflection Career reflection Searching for a job Searching for a job Applying for a job Applying for a job What to expect What to expect Preparing for an interview Preparing for an interview FAQs FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Policies & Procedures Contact Us Contact Us Skip to content Skip to navigation Home Home icon Monash Australia Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Courses Monash Online Library Donate Staff Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Students Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Alumni Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Search Menu Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Healthy Workplace Campus life Job search at Monash How to apply International applicants Career reflection Searching for a job Applying for a job What to expect Preparing for an interview FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us More Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us Toggle Search Close Close\n                        Search Search You are here: Home | Job Search Job Search Applicant login Job alert Job Search e.g. Lecturer, Admin assistant Refine Search Categories Professional Administration 1 Locations Off-campus Other 1 Work type Fixed-term (Full-time) 1 Faculty / Portfolio Faculty of Medicine Nursing and Health Sciences 1 Level / Salary HEW 5 ($86,344 - $99,179) 1 New Search Clinical Site Administrator Job No.: 697855 Location: MRH Gippsland Sites: Bairnsdale, Leongatha, Sale, Traralgon or Warragul Employment Type: Full-time Duration: 3 year Fixed-term appointment Remuneration: HEW 5 ($86,344 - $99,179) plus 17% superannuation Amplify your impact at a world top 50 University Join our inclusive, collaborative community Be surrounded by extraordinary ideas - and the people who discover them The Opportunity Join the Monash Rural Health Gippsland team as a Clinical Site Administrator and play a key role in supporting the delivery of the Year 3B rural medical education program. You’ll provide high-quality administrative and operational support across Gippsland, coordinating student placements, timetabling, assessment tracking, reporting and other activities that contribute to effective clinical education. You’ll work closely with students, clinical academic staff and a broad range of internal and external stakeholders to ensure a seamless placement experience. The role also provides pastoral support to students, assists with facility operations and contributes to continuous improvement across the Gippsland sites. About You You’ll be an organised and proactive administrator with strong customer service skills and the ability to manage competing priorities independently. You’ll bring sound judgement, attention to detail and a solutions-focused approach, with the ability to navigate complex matters sensitively and professionally. You’ll have excellent written and verbal communication skills and enjoy building positive relationships with a diverse range of people. Strong computer literacy and experience with Microsoft Office, databases and administrative systems will be highly regarded, along with the ability to work collaboratively and contribute to a supportive team environment. *Please note: This position involves travel to various University locations, some of which may not be easily accessible by public transport. A valid driver’s licence is therefore essential. About Monash University At Monash , work feels different. There’s a sense of belonging, from contributing to something groundbreaking – a place where great things happen. We value difference and diversity , and welcome and celebrate everyone's contributions, lived experience and expertise. That’s why we champion an inclusive and respectful workplace culture where everyone is supported to succeed. Learn more about Monash . Join the pursuit of our purpose to build a better future for ourselves and our communities - #ChangeIt with us. Monash supports flexible and hybrid working arrangements. We have a range of policies in place enabling staff to combine work and personal commitments. This includes supporting parents . To Apply For instructions on how to apply, please refer to ' How to apply for Monash Jobs '. Diversity is one of our greatest strengths at Monash. We encourage applications from Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander people, culturally and linguistically diverse people, people with disabilities, neurodivergent people, and people of all genders, sexualities, and age groups. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and accessible recruitment process at Monash. If you need any reasonable adjustments, please contact us at hr-recruitment@monash.edu in an email titled 'Reasonable Adjustments Request' for a confidential discussion. Your employment is contingent upon the satisfactory completion of all pre-employment and/or background checks required for the role, as determined by the University. Enquiries: Ms Ketrah Parsonage, Regional Manager - Gippsland, +61 (0)447 808 458 Position Description: Clinical Site Administrator Applications Close: Wednesday 16th of September 2026, 11:55pm AEST Supporting a diverse workforce Back to search results Email Job Apply now Monash University recognises that its Australian campuses are located on the unceded lands of the people of the Kulin nations, and pays its respects to their elders, past and present. Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Position Location Level / Salary Closes Clinical Site Administrator Other HEW 5 ($86,344 - $99,179) 16 Sep 2026 Support rural medical education through student placements, administration and pastoral care across Gippsland, working with diverse stakeholders. Current opportunities Position Location Level / Salary Closes Clinical Site Administrator Other HEW 5 ($86,344 - $99,179) 16 Sep 2026 Support rural medical education through student placements, administration and pastoral care across Gippsland, working with diverse stakeholders. Powered by PageUp We acknowledge and pay respects to the Elders and Traditional Owners of the land on which our Australian campuses stand. Information for Indigenous Australians Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Monash Sitemap Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news