      "title": "Job Search - Jobs at Monash",
      "description": "Job Search - Jobs at Monash Home Courses Monash Online Library Donate Previous menu Toggle navigation Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Benefits Healthy Workplace Healthy Workplace Campus life Campus life Job search at Monash Job search at Monash How to apply How to apply How to apply International applicants International applicants Career reflection Career reflection Searching for a job Searching for a job Applying for a job Applying for a job What to expect What to expect Preparing for an interview Preparing for an interview FAQs FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Policies & Procedures Contact Us Contact Us Skip to content Skip to navigation Home Home icon Monash Australia Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Courses Monash Online Library Donate Staff Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Students Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Alumni Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Search Menu Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Healthy Workplace Campus life Job search at Monash How to apply International applicants Career reflection Searching for a job Applying for a job What to expect Preparing for an interview FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us More Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us Toggle Search Close Close\n                        Search Search You are here: Home | Job Search Job Search Applicant login Job alert Job Search e.g. Lecturer, Admin assistant Refine Search Categories Professional Student Services 1 Locations Campus Caulfield campus 1 Work type Casual 1 Faculty / Portfolio Faculty of Business and Economics 1 Level / Salary HEW 6 ($100,155 - $108,106) 1 New Search Casual Senior Student Services Officer Job No.: 698356 Location: Caulfield campus Employment Type: Casual full time until 19 Dec 2026 Remuneration: Casual HEW 6 rates will apply Be inspired, every day Take your career in exciting, rewarding directions Be a part of an inclusive, collaborative community The Opportunity The Monash Business School is looking for a casual Senior Student Services Officer to provide high-level administrative and student services support across the Business School, helping deliver an excellent experience throughout the student lifecycle. You will provide specialist advice, resolve complex student enquiries and support activities including course advice, admissions, enrolment, progression, completion and co-curricular programs. This casual role will suit someone who enjoys working in a busy and varied environment and can use sound judgement to manage complex matters. You will contribute to continuous improvement, data and reporting activities, and build strong relationships with students, staff and stakeholders to support consistent and effective service delivery. About You You will have experience in student services, administration or a related environment, with excellent organisational skills and a strong commitment to delivering high-quality customer service. You will be confident managing competing priorities, solving problems and developing effective administrative processes and systems. You will have strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to work independently and collaboratively and exercise initiative and judgement when dealing with complex matters. Experience working in a complex educational environment and familiarity with student administration systems such as Callista will be highly regarded. About Monash University At Monash , work feels different. There’s a sense of belonging, from contributing to something groundbreaking – a place where great things happen. We value difference and diversity , and welcome and celebrate everyone's contributions, lived experience and expertise. That’s why we champion an inclusive and respectful workplace culture where everyone is supported to succeed. Learn more about Monash . Join the pursuit of our purpose to build a better future for ourselves and our communities - #ChangeIt with us. To Apply To apply, please submit your application via the “Apply Now” button. Your application must address the Key Selection Criteria. Diversity is one of our greatest strengths at Monash. We encourage applications from Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander people, culturally and linguistically diverse people, people with disabilities, neurodivergent people, and people of all genders, sexualities, and age groups. Should you require any specific support or adjustments throughout the recruitment process and beyond, please get in touch at hr-recruitment@monash.edu and we'll be happy to assist. Your employment is contingent upon the satisfactory completion of all pre-employment and/or background checks required for the role, as determined by the University. Enquiries: Bernadette Carpenter, Course Advice and Support Manager, +61 03 9905 3113 Position Description: Senior Student Services Officer Applications Close: Tuesday 22nd of September 2026, 11:55pm AEST Supporting a diverse workforce Back to search results Email Job Apply now Monash University recognises that its Australian campuses are located on the unceded lands of the people of the Kulin nations, and pays its respects to their elders, past and present. Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your