      "title": "Job Search - Jobs at Monash",
      "description": "Job Search - Jobs at Monash Home Courses Monash Online Library Donate Previous menu Toggle navigation Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Benefits Healthy Workplace Healthy Workplace Campus life Campus life Job search at Monash Job search at Monash How to apply How to apply How to apply International applicants International applicants Career reflection Career reflection Searching for a job Searching for a job Applying for a job Applying for a job What to expect What to expect Preparing for an interview Preparing for an interview FAQs FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Policies & Procedures Contact Us Contact Us Skip to content Skip to navigation Home Home icon Monash Australia Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Courses Monash Online Library Donate Staff Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Students Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Alumni Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Search Menu Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Healthy Workplace Campus life Job search at Monash How to apply International applicants Career reflection Searching for a job Applying for a job What to expect Preparing for an interview FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us More Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us Toggle Search Close Close\n                        Search Search You are here: Home | Job Search Job Search Applicant login Job alert Job Search e.g. Lecturer, Admin assistant Refine Search Categories Professional Research (Admin. Support) 1 Locations Off-campus St Kilda Road 1 Work type Fixed-term (Full-time) 1 Faculty / Portfolio Faculty of Medicine Nursing and Health Sciences 1 Level / Salary HEW 7 ($110,527 - $121,227) 1 New Search Clinical Research Associate Job No.: 697931 Location: 509St Kilda Road campus Employment Type: Full time Duration: 12 months fixed-term appointment Remuneration: $110,527 – $121,227 pa HEW 07 (plus 17% employer superannuation) Amplify your impact at a world top 50 University Join our inclusive, collaborative community Be surrounded by extraordinary ideas - and the people who discover them The Opportunity The School of Public Health and Preventive Medicine is seeking a Clinical Research Associate to support the Transfusion Research Unit in delivering high-quality, investigator-initiated clinical trials. In this role, you’ll oversee trial activities from site set-up and staff training through to data monitoring, reporting and completion, contributing to high-impact research outcomes. Working closely with hospital sites, investigators and research partners, you’ll provide expert advice and coordinate essential clinical trial activities, including HREC and regulatory submissions, contracts, documentation and investigator meetings. You’ll also support the day-to-day delivery of trials, ensuring research protocols, quality standards and patient safety requirements are consistently met. We’re seeking an experienced clinical research professional with demonstrated clinical trial coordination experience and a current Good Clinical Practice (GCP) certificate. You’ll bring strong project management, analytical and organisational skills, along with the confidence to work independently, build effective stakeholder relationships and provide specialist advice across complex research activities. Previous experience conducting investigator-initiated trials and on-site monitoring visits will be highly regarded. About Monash University At Monash , work feels different. There’s a sense of belonging, from contributing to something groundbreaking – a place where great things happen. We value difference and diversity , and welcome and celebrate everyone's contributions, lived experience and expertise. That’s why we champion an inclusive and respectful workplace culture where everyone is supported to succeed. Learn more about Monash . Join the pursuit of our purpose to build a better future for ourselves and our communities - #ChangeIt with us. Monash supports flexible and hybrid working arrangements. We have a range of policies in place enabling staff to combine work and personal commitments. This includes supporting parents . To Apply For instructions on how to apply, please refer to ' How to apply for Monash Jobs '. Your application must address the Key Selection Criteria. Diversity is one of our greatest strengths at Monash. We encourage applications from Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander people, culturally and linguistically diverse people, people with disabilities, neurodivergent people, and people of all genders, sexualities, and age groups. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and accessible recruitment process at Monash. If you need any reasonable adjustments, please contact us at hr-recruitment@monash.edu in an email titled 'Reasonable Adjustments Request' for a confidential discussion. Your employment is contingent upon the satisfactory completion of all pre-employment and/or background checks required for the role, as determined by the University. Enquiries: Naomi Aoki, Business Projects Manager, naomi.aoki@monash.edu Position Description: Clinical Research Associate Applications Close: Sunday, 20th September at 11:55pm AEST Supporting a diverse workforce Back to search results Email Job Apply now Monash University recognises that its Australian campuses are located on the unceded lands of the people of the Kulin nations, and pays its respects to their elders, past and present. Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Position Location Level / Salary Closes Clinical Research Associate St Kilda Road HEW 7 ($110,527 - $121,227) 20 Sep 2026 Seeking a Clinical Research Associate to support the Transfusion Research Unit in delivering high-quality, investigator-initiated clinical trials. In this role, you’ll oversee trial activities from site set-up and staff training through to data monitoring, reporting and completion, contributing to high-impact research outcomes. Current opportunities Position Location Level / Salary Closes Clinical Research Associate St Kilda Road HEW 7 ($110,527 - $121,227) 20 Sep 2026 Seeking a Clinical Research Associate to support the Transfusion Research Unit in delivering high-quality, investigator-initiated clinical trials. In this role, you’ll oversee trial activities from site set-up and staff training through to data monitoring, reporting and completion, contributing to high-impact research outcomes. Powered by PageUp We acknowledge and pay respects to the Elders and Traditional Owners of the land on which our Australian campuses stand. Information for Indigenous Australians Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Monash Sitemap Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Monash Sitemap Registered Australian University ABN: 12 377 614 012 TEQSA Provider ID: PRV12140 CRICOS Provider Number Monash University: 00008C Monash College: 01857J Authorised by Executive Director, Marketing Website feedback Last updated: Nov 2022 Accessibility Disclaimer & copyright Terms & conditions Data privacy & cyber security Data Consent Settings Copyright © 2026 Monash University We use cookies to improve your experience, but you can choose which ones we use, and opt-out at any time. You can find more information in our Website Terms and Conditions Accept  all Cookie settings"
