      "title": "Job Search - Jobs at Monash",
      "description": "Job Search - Jobs at Monash Home Courses Monash Online Library Donate Previous menu Toggle navigation Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Benefits Healthy Workplace Healthy Workplace Campus life Campus life Job search at Monash Job search at Monash How to apply How to apply How to apply International applicants International applicants Career reflection Career reflection Searching for a job Searching for a job Applying for a job Applying for a job What to expect What to expect Preparing for an interview Preparing for an interview FAQs FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Policies & Procedures Contact Us Contact Us Skip to content Skip to navigation Home Home icon Monash Australia Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Courses Monash Online Library Donate Staff Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Students Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Alumni Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Search Menu Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Healthy Workplace Campus life Job search at Monash How to apply International applicants Career reflection Searching for a job Applying for a job What to expect Preparing for an interview FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us More Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us Toggle Search Close Close\n                        Search Search You are here: Home | Job Search Job Search Applicant login Job alert Job Search e.g. Lecturer, Admin assistant Refine Search Categories Academic Academic - Education focused 1 Locations Monash Teaching Hospitals Monash Rural Health Churchill 1 Work type Continuing (Part-time) 1 Faculty / Portfolio Faculty of Medicine Nursing and Health Sciences 1 Level / Salary Level B ($123,138 - $146,228) 1 New Search Lecturer (Education Focused), Monash Rural Health Churchill Job No.: 686949 Location: Monash Rural Health Churchill Employment Type: Part-time, fraction (0.7) Duration: Continuing appointment Remuneration: Pro-rata of $123,138 - $146,228 pa Level B (plus 17% employer superannuation) Amplify your impact as an Education-focused Lecturer Join our inclusive, collaborative medical education community Shape the future of medicine education through exceptional teaching The Opportunity The School of Rural Health is seeking an Education-Focused Lecturer to contribute to the delivery and ongoing development of medicine education at Monash Rural Health in Churchill. This position will play an important role in medicine course assessment and contribute to teaching the pharmacology component of the Year A program, supporting a high-quality student learning experience within a contemporary medical education environment. The position will contribute to the design and implementation of high-quality assessment and evaluation processes that support effective learning and provide meaningful insights into the student experience. Working collaboratively across the Years 1 and 2 programs, the position will liaise with colleagues at Clayton, Mildura and in Malaysia to support consistency and alignment in content delivery and assessment, while contributing to evidence-informed approaches to educational design and delivery. The position is suited to an education-focused academic with a relevant tertiary qualification and demonstrated knowledge and skills in contemporary teaching, assessment and evaluation practices within a higher education or medical education setting. A sound understanding of pharmacology and the ability to work collaboratively across academic teams will support the successful delivery of the role. Join Monash Rural Health and contribute to the delivery of high-quality medical education and assessment that supports the learning and development of future health professionals. We look forward to receiving your application. Travelling to various University campuses may be part of the position, and possessing a valid driver's license is crucial for performing the responsibilities. About Monash University At Monash , work feels different. There’s a sense of belonging, from contributing to something ground breaking – a place where great things happen. We value difference and diversity , and welcome and celebrate everyone's contributions, lived experience and expertise. That’s why we champion an inclusive and respectful workplace culture where everyone is supported to succeed. Some 20,000 staff work for Monash around the world. We have 95,000 students, four Australian campuses, and campuses in Malaysia and Indonesia. We also have a major presence in India and China, and a significant centre and research foundation in Italy. In our short history, we have skyrocketed through global university rankings and established ourselves consistently among the world's best tertiary institutions. We rank in the world’s top-50 universities in rankings including the QS World University Rankings 2026. Together with our commitment to academic freedom , you will have access to quality research facilities, infrastructure, world-class teaching spaces, and international collaboration opportunities. Learn more about Monash . Today, we have the momentum to create the future we need for generations to come. Accelerate your change here. Monash supports flexible and hybrid working arrangements. We have a range of policies in place enabling staff to combine work and personal commitments. This includes supporting parents . To Apply For instructions on how to apply, please refer to ' How to apply for Monash Jobs '. Your application must address the Key Selection Criteria. Diversity is one of our greatest strengths at Monash. We encourage applications from Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander people, culturally and linguistically diverse people, people with disabilities, neurodivergent people, and people of all genders, sexualities, and age groups. Your employment is contingent upon the satisfactory completion of all pre-employment and/or background checks required for the role, as determined by the University. Enquiries: Associate Professor Marianne Tare, Director - Monash Rural Health Churchill, +61 3 5122 7485 Position Description: Lecturer (Education Focused) Applications Close: Thursday 15 October 2026, 11:55pm AEST Supporting a diverse workforce Back to search results Email Job Apply now Monash University recognises that its Australian campuses are located on the unceded lands of the people of the Kulin nations, and pays its respects to their elders, past and present. Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Position Location Level / Salary Closes Lecturer (Education Focused), Monash Rural Health Churchill Monash Rural Health Churchill Level B ($123,138 - $146,228) 15 Oct 2026 Join as an Education-focused Lecturer and shape the future of medical education. Current opportunities Position Location Level / Salary Closes Lecturer (Education Focused), Monash Rural Health Churchill Monash Rural Health Churchill Level B ($123,138 - $146,228) 15 Oct 2026 Join as an Education-focused Lecturer and shape the future of medical education. Powered by PageUp We acknowledge and pay respects to the Elders and Traditional Owners of the land on which our Australian campuses stand. Information for Indigenous Australians Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Monash Sitemap Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Monash Sitemap Registered Australian University ABN: 12 377 614 012 TEQSA Provider ID: PRV12140 CRICOS Provider Number Monash University: 00008C Monash College: 01857J Authorised by Executive Director, Marketing Website feedback Last updated: Nov 2022 Accessibility Disclaimer & copyright Terms & conditions Data privacy & cyber security Data Consent Settings Copyright © 2026 Monash University We use cookies to improve your experience, but you can choose which ones we use, and opt-out at any time. You can find more information in our Website Terms and Conditions Accept  all Cookie settings"
