    "https://careers.pageuppeople.com/513/cw/en/job/697309/program-director-cyber-and-infrastructure-strategic-program-delivery": {
      "title": "Job Search - Jobs at Monash",
      "description": "Job Search - Jobs at Monash Home Courses Monash Online Library Donate Previous menu Toggle navigation Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Benefits Healthy Workplace Healthy Workplace Campus life Campus life Job search at Monash Job search at Monash How to apply How to apply How to apply International applicants International applicants Career reflection Career reflection Searching for a job Searching for a job Applying for a job Applying for a job What to expect What to expect Preparing for an interview Preparing for an interview FAQs FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Policies & Procedures Contact Us Contact Us Skip to content Skip to navigation Home Home icon Monash Australia Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Courses Monash Online Library Donate Staff Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Students Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Alumni Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Search Menu Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Healthy Workplace Campus life Job search at Monash How to apply International applicants Career reflection Searching for a job Applying for a job What to expect Preparing for an interview FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us More Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us Toggle Search Close Close\n                        Search Search You are here: Home | Job Search Job Search Applicant login Job alert Job Search e.g. Lecturer, Admin assistant Refine Search Categories Professional IT 1 Locations Campus Clayton campus 1 Work type Fixed-term (Full-time) 1 Faculty / Portfolio eSolutions 1 Level / Salary - A competitive remuneration package will apply 1 New Search Program Director, Cyber and Infrastructure Strategic Program Delivery Job No.: 697309 Location: Clayton campus Employment Type: Full-time Duration: 3 year fixed-term appointment Remuneration: This position is classified at HEW 10+, with a competitive remuneration package available Amplify your impact at a world top 50 University Join our inclusive, collaborative community Be surrounded by extraordinary ideas - and the people who discover them The Opportunity This is a senior enterprise leadership opportunity to shape Monash Group’s most critical cyber security, infrastructure and technology transformation priorities. As a Program Director – Cyber & Infrastructure Strategic Program Delivery, you will lead a high-value portfolio of enterprise-critical initiatives spanning cyber uplift, infrastructure modernisation, operational resilience, identity, platforms and strategic technology enablement. You will shape investment, prioritisation, sequencing, risk and delivery strategy, providing trusted advice to executives and governance bodies to drive enterprise value and measurable outcomes. You will lead a high-performing multidisciplinary delivery function, strengthen portfolio and governance capability, and leverage AI, automation and data-driven practices to enhance execution and organisational performance. Partnering with the GCISO & Head of Infrastructure Strategy, you will influence strategic planning, transformation and executive decision-making, helping shape the future of cyber security and infrastructure across Monash Group. About You: You bring extensive experience leading enterprise technology portfolios and transformation within complex organisations, with strong expertise across cyber security, infrastructure and strategic delivery. You are a confident executive influencer and strategic leader, with a proven ability to lead high-performing multidisciplinary teams and navigate complex stakeholder and governance environments. You bring strong commercial, financial, portfolio and risk management capability, alongside a contemporary understanding of delivery, benefits realisation, AI and automation. You are an exceptional strategic thinker and communicator, able to navigate ambiguity, shape decisions and drive enterprise-wide outcomes About Monash University At Monash , work feels different. There’s a sense of belonging, from contributing to something ground breaking – a place where great things happen. We value difference and diversity , and welcome and celebrate everyone's contributions, lived experience and expertise. That’s why we champion an inclusive and respectful workplace culture where everyone is supported to succeed. Some 20,000 staff work for Monash around the world. We have 95,000 students, four Australian campuses, and campuses in Malaysia and Indonesia. We also have a major presence in India and China, and a significant centre and research foundation in Italy. In our short history, we have skyrocketed through global university rankings and established ourselves consistently among the world's best tertiary institutions. We rank in the world’s top-50 universities in rankings including the QS World University Rankings 2026. Learn more about Monash . Today, we have the momentum to create the future we need for generations to come. Accelerate your change here. Monash supports flexible and hybrid working arrangements. We have a range of policies in place enabling staff to combine work and personal commitments. This includes supporting parents . To Apply For instructions on how to apply, please refer to ' How to apply for Monash Jobs '. Diversity is one of our greatest strengths at Monash. We encourage applications from Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander people, culturally and linguistically diverse people, people with disabilities, neurodivergent people, and people of all genders, sexualities, and age groups. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and accessible recruitment process at Monash. If you need any reasonable adjustments, please contact us at hr-recruitment@monash.edu in an email titled 'Reasonable Adjustments Request' for a confidential discussion. Your employment is contingent upon the satisfactory completion of all pre-employment and/or background checks required for the role, as determined by the University. Enquiries: Sara Cheung-Chin, Talent Partner, Sara.Cheung-Chin@monash.edu Position Description: Program Director Cyber and Infrastructure Applications Close: Sunday 4th October 2026, 11:55pm AEST Supporting a diverse workforce Back to search results Email Job Apply now Monash University recognises that its Australian campuses are located on the unceded lands of the people of the Kulin nations, and pays its respects to their elders, past and present. Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Position Location Level / Salary Closes Program Director, Cyber and Infrastructure Strategic Program Delivery Clayton campus - A competitive remuneration package will apply 4 Oct 2026 Lead Monash Group’s critical cyber, infrastructure and technology transformation portfolio, driving security, resilience and strategic enablement! Current opportunities Position Location Level / Salary Closes Program Director, Cyber and Infrastructure Strategic Program Delivery Clayton campus - A competitive remuneration package will apply 4 Oct 2026 Lead Monash Group’s critical cyber, infrastructure and technology transformation portfolio, driving security, resilience and strategic enablement! Powered by PageUp We acknowledge and pay respects to the Elders and Traditional Owners of the land on which our Australian campuses stand. Information for Indigenous Australians Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Monash Sitemap Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Monash Sitemap Registered Australian University ABN: 12 377 614 012 TEQSA Provider ID: PRV12140 CRICOS Provider Number Monash University: 00008C Monash College: 01857J Authorised by Executive Director, Marketing Website feedback Last updated: Nov 2022 Accessibility Disclaimer & copyright Terms & conditions Data privacy & cyber security Data Consent Settings Copyright © 2026 Monash University We use cookies to improve your experience, but you can choose which ones we use, and opt-out at any time. You can find more information in our Website Terms and Conditions Accept  all Cookie settings"
